WEBVTT

00:05:31.196 --> 00:05:32.476
"Well, of course they did.

00:05:33.116 --> 00:05:36.796
Someone like that -- that's not
the right kind of person

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:39.356
to run a successful business."

00:05:39.996 --> 00:05:43.556
And so that message compounds,
and we just internalize it.

00:05:44.796 --> 00:05:49.036
So I think all of this logically
leads us to two questions,

00:05:49.076 --> 00:05:51.196
the first of which is:

00:05:51.196 --> 00:05:52.556
Why is this happening?

00:05:53.916 --> 00:05:56.476
Why are businesses that are in trouble

00:05:56.516 --> 00:05:59.716
more likely to appoint
an underrepresented leader?